{"step_index":1375,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-25T14:28:52Z","input_tokens":2591,"cache_read_tokens":72892,"output_tokens":2186,"thinking":"Adding Phase 4 interactive prediction styling requires defining several CSS classes and states. Specific selectors include styles for toggling the quiz button, the interactive prediction card itself, its header, badge groups, and skip button. Further styles will handle question text, choice wrappers, and choice buttons, considering various states like hover, disabled, correct, and incorrect.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Add styles for interactive prediction card, toggle button, choices, and result feedback","EndLine":2837,"Instruction":"Append Phase 4 styles at the end of styles.css","ReplacementContent":"  .iterations-explorer-section,\n  .advanced-drawer {\n    margin: 0 10px 16px 10px;\n    padding: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .predict-choices-wrap {\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n\n  .predict-choice-btn {\n    width: 100%;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   PHASE 4: INTERACTIVE LEARNING & PREDICTION SYSTEM\n   ========================================================= */\n#btnToggleQuiz.active {\n  background: #fef3c7;\n  color: #92400e;\n  border-color: #f59e0b;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25);\n}\n\n.interactive-predict-card {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fffdfa 0%, #fef8ee 100%);\n  border: 2px solid #fde68a;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 15px 18px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);\n  animation: predictEntrance calc(0.35s * var(--anim-speed-factor, 1)) cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) both;\n}\n\n@keyframes predictEntrance {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(-8px) scale(0.99);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateY(0) scale(1);\n  }\n}\n\n.predict-card-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 10px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.predict-badge-group {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.predict-badge {\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  background: #f59e0b;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  padding: 3px 9px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n}\n\n.predict-subprompt {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  color: #78350f;\n  background: #fef3c7;\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.btn-predict-skip {\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: #b45309;\n  border: 1px dashed #d97706;\n  padding: 4px 10px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.btn-predict-skip:hover {\n  background: #fde68a;\n  color: #78350f;\n}\n\n.predict-question-text {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #1e293b;\n  line-height: 1.35;\n}\n\n.predict-choices-wrap {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.predict-choice-btn {\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 13.5px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 9px 16px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  color: #334155;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.predict-choice-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  border-color: #2563eb;\n  background: #eff6ff;\n  color: #1d4ed8;\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12);\n}\n\n.predict-choice-btn:disabled {\n  cursor: default;\n  opacity: 0.9;\n}\n\n.predict-choice-btn.is-correct {\n  border-color: #10b981;\n  background: #ecfdf5;\n  color: #065f46;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25);\n}\n\n.predict-choice-btn.is-incorrect {\n  border-color: #ef4444;\n  background: #fef2f2;\n  color: #991b1b;\n  text-decoration: line-through;\n  opacity: 0.75;\n}\n\n.predict-result-box {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n  border-left: 4px solid #10b981;\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 4px;\n  animation: predictResultPop calc(0.3s * var(--anim-speed-factor, 1)) ease-out both;\n}\n\n.predict-result-box.was-wrong {\n  border-left-color: #f59e0b;\n}\n\n.predict-result-box.was-revealed {\n  border-left-color: #3b82f6;\n}\n\n@keyframes predictResultPop {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(4px);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateY(0);\n  }\n}\n\n.predict-result-header {\n  font-size: 13.5px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #0f172a;\n}\n\n.predict-result-body {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: #475569;\n  line-height: 1.45;\n}\n","StartLine":2830,"TargetContent":"  .iterations-explorer-section,\n  .advanced-drawer {\n    margin: 0 10px 16px 10px;\n    padding: 12px;\n  }\n}\n","TargetFile":"C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/styles.css","toolAction":"Updating styles.css","toolSummary":"Add Phase 4 CSS styles"}}]}
